skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false

' =========================================================
' FFI DATA STRUCTURE
' =========================================================

class DartToRustElementFFI {
  + row : u8
  + col : u8
  + selectedNum : u8
  + selectedNumStateList[2]
  + selectedCandList[9]
  + selectedPatternList[4]
  + requestedElementHighLightType[5]
  + requestedCandHighLightType[9]
}

note right of DartToRustElementFFI
Represents one Sudoku cell.

Important fields for pattern detection:

selectedNum
selectedCandList[9]
requestedCandHighLightType[9]
end note


' =========================================================
' PATTERN CONSTANTS
' =========================================================

class PatternList {
  + HI_LIGHT_ON : u8
  + PAIRS : u8
  + SINGLES : u8
  + GIVENS : u8
}


' =========================================================
' PUBLIC FFI FUNCTIONS
' =========================================================

class check_all_elements {
  + check_all_elements(ptr, len)
}

class check_one_element {
  + check_one_element(ptr, idx)
}


' =========================================================
' INTERNAL LOGIC
' =========================================================

class check_cell_for_patterns {
  - reset highlights
  - count candidates
  - detect pairs
  - detect singles
}

check_all_elements --> DartToRustElementFFI
check_one_element --> DartToRustElementFFI

check_all_elements --> check_cell_for_patterns
check_one_element --> check_cell_for_patterns

check_cell_for_patterns --> PatternList


note right of check_cell_for_patterns
Pattern detection logic:

1. Reset highlight list

2. If selectedNum == 0
   count active candidates

3. If candidate count == 2
   → highlight as PAIRS

4. If candidate count == 1
   → highlight as SINGLES
end note

@enduml